`--root proj=specs` renders one root: the ADR's `values:` ref and its anchored body link resolve to
the value's page, the `[clarify]` mark lands on the root index, and the link to a missing file is
the one warning.

-- fixtures/cwd/specs/value/0001-small-steps.md --
---
type: value
title: Small steps
summary: Ship in small, reviewable steps.
kind: value
---

# Small steps

## Why

Small changes are cheap to review.
-- fixtures/cwd/specs/rule/0001-one-concern-per-commit.md --
---
type: rule
title: One concern per commit
summary: A commit carries one concern.
status: accepted
values: [value/0001]
---

# One concern per commit

Split unrelated changes.
